]},"ordering_evidence":"huowang-q-3d9c5334ca3b343a40c4","source_order":[41,169,370],"order":7452},{"id":"huowang-e-o165","title":"何祗卒年四十八","accounts":[{"id":"huowang-a-911feba26123fd518c33","label":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","text":"何祗卒年四十八","evidence":["huowang-q-b791be2b24d8cd28854a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"huangli-p0001","role":"转为犍为太守，年四十八卒，如赵直所占所言","evidence":["huowang-q-b791be2b24d8cd28854a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["huowang-q-b791be2b24d8cd28854a"]},"ordering_evidence":"huowang-q-b791be2b24d8cd28854a","source_order":[41,169,422],"order":7453},{"id":"huangli-e-o139","title":"何祗倾财医张嶷","accounts":[{"id":"huangli-a-f7c0a2a1d024b44142f6","label":"正文","text":"何祗倾财医张嶷","evidence":["huangli-q-f6c68a25de715bdf7eb7"]}],"participants":[{"person":"houzhu-p0028","role":"疾病困笃，宿与祗疏阔，乃自舆诣祗托以治疾","evidence":["huangli-q-f6c68a25de715bdf7eb7"]},{"person":"huangli-p0001","role":"倾财医疗，数年除愈","evidence":["huangli-q-f6c68a25de715bdf7eb7"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["huangli-q-f6c68a25de715bdf7eb7"]},"ordering_evidence":"huangli-q-f6c68a25de715bdf7eb7","source_order":[43,195,0],"order":7666}],"persons":[{"id":"huangli-p0001","name":"何祗","evidence":["huangli-q-f6c68a25de715bdf7eb7","huowang-q-af1060d585bdd4c66289","huowang-q-9630f7b77420e667e935","huowang-q-bc8bcc755c2108f27c9f","huowang-q-4c21c2def03f347d75d8","huowang-q-5d6e8cfdee011833d8ba","huowang-q-25edf104ab8078c8ae45","huowang-q-42262cc1f83283283376","huowang-q-683ad9f01337efefc80d","huowang-q-ab8aa585a2bce55208a5","huowang-q-3d9c5334ca3b343a40c4","huowang-q-b791be2b24d8cd28854a"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huangli-q-f6c68a25de715bdf7eb7","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-09920a0e0e8e165d060e","layer":"original","quote":"后得疾病困笃，家素贫匮；广汉太守蜀郡何祗，名为通厚〖9〗；嶷宿与疏阔〖10〗，乃自舆诣祗〖11〗，托以治疾。祗倾财医疗，数年除愈","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64},{"id":"huowang-q-25edf104ab8078c8ae45","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"亮甚异之，出补成都令；时郫县令缺，以祗兼二县","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":249,"end":271},{"id":"huowang-q-3d9c5334ca3b343a40c4","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"迁广汉。后夷反叛，辞〔曰〕：‘令得前何府君，乃能安我耳！’时难〔复〕屈祗，拔祗族人为〔之〕，汶山复得安","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":370,"end":421},{"id":"huowang-q-42262cc1f83283283376","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"二县户口猥多，切近都治，饶诸奸秽。每比人，常眠睡；值其觉寤，辄得奸诈。众咸畏祗之发摘，或以为有术，无敢欺者","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":272,"end":325},{"id":"huowang-q-4c21c2def03f347d75d8","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"初仕郡，后为督军从事","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":165,"end":175},{"id":"huowang-q-5d6e8cfdee011833d8ba","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"时诸葛亮用法峻密，阴闻祗游戏放纵，不勤所职；尝奄往录狱，众人咸为祗惧。祗密闻之，夜张灯火见囚，读诸解状。诸葛晨往，祗悉已暗诵；答对解释，无所凝滞。亮甚异之","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":176,"end":253},{"id":"huowang-q-683ad9f01337efefc80d","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"使人投算，祗听其读而心计之；不差升合，其精如此","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":326,"end":349},{"id":"huowang-q-9630f7b77420e667e935","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"每朝会，祗次洪坐。嘲祗曰：‘君马何驶？’祗曰：‘故吏马不敢驶，但明府未著鞭耳！’众传之以为笑","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":16,"end":62},{"id":"huowang-q-ab8aa585a2bce55208a5","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"汶山夷不安，以祗为汶山太守，民、夷服信","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":350,"end":369},{"id":"huowang-q-af1060d585bdd4c66289","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-9fdcbc190275cf56490e","layer":"original","quote":"洪迎门下书佐何祗〖34〗，有才策功干〖35〗，举郡吏，数年为广汉太守；时洪亦尚在蜀郡","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":30,"end":72},{"id":"huowang-q-b791be2b24d8cd28854a","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"转祗为犍为。年四十八卒，如直所言","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":422,"end":438},{"id":"huowang-q-bc8bcc755c2108f27c9f","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"尝梦井中生桑，以问占梦赵直，直曰：‘桑非井中之物，会当移植；然“桑”字四十下八，君寿恐不过此。’祗笑言：‘得此足矣！","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":106,"end":164}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
